<title>FINLAND: MINISTRY PICKS TIETO FOR FIM 75 MLN DEAL.</title>
<headline>MINISTRY PICKS TIETO FOR FIM 75 MLN DEAL.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finnish Ministry of Justice said in a statement on Tuesday it had decided to award to TT Tieto Oy a three-year contract worth 75 million markka for data systems services.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
